{{!< default}}
{{!-- WHS Brief: custom route (not a collection) rendering only #blog-tagged
posts via {{#get}}. Posts still get the site's normal /{slug}/ permalink
(from the unfiltered "/" collection in routes.yaml) — this page is purely a
filtered browsing view, not a permalink prefix. See routes.yaml.

Header uses the same slim .wbd-masthead treatment as brief.hbs /
industry-brief.hbs (eyebrow/h1/dek, no big Casper hero band) instead of the
default theme's tall .site-header-content block, matching the About page's
plain in-content title too. --}}

<main id="site-main" class="site-main outer">
<div class="inner posts">

    <div class="whs-brief-doc">
        <div class="wbd-masthead">
            <p class="wbd-eyebrow">WHS Brief</p>
            <h1>Blog</h1>
            <p class="wbd-dek">Free WHS/OHS updates and explainers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="post-feed">
        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:blog" limit="all" include="tags,authors" as |posts|}}
            {{#foreach posts}}
                {{> "post-card"}}
            {{else}}
                <p class="none">No posts yet.</p>
            {{/foreach}}
        {{/get}}
    </div>

</div>
</main>
